    {
      "id": "BjGfsXSm9LZ1mWWQcpgot",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 198.92344407580742,
      "y": -2528.67227434481,
      "width": 1235.8790283203125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1542872379,
      "version": 1101,
      "versionNonce": 2087931195,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786530054706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If we have 100M DAU and each user does only 1 redirect, then will have 100M redirects\nSo, 100M = 10^8 and \n    seconds in day = 24 X 60 X 60 = 86,400 ~ 1,00,000 ~ 10^5 \nSo, redirect per second = 10^8 / 10^5 ~ 10^3 ~ 1K rps\n    max load can be 100 times = 100k rps\n\nSo, rps = 10k - 100k\n\nSo, if we have 100:1 read/write ratio then will have 500 - 1k write per second. For write, we won't need multiple app instances.\n\nSo, we can have microservice architecture. One service will handle the write and which doesn't need to be scale.\nand another service will handle all the reads which will scale i.e. multiple instances of it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If we have 100M DAU and each user does only 1 redirect, then will have 100M redirects\nSo, 100M = 10^8 and \n    seconds in day = 24 X 60 X 60 = 86,400 ~ 1,00,000 ~ 10^5 \nSo, redirect per second = 10^8 / 10^5 ~ 10^3 ~ 1K rps\n    max load can be 100 times = 100k rps\n\nSo, rps = 10k - 100k\n\nSo, if we have 100:1 read/write ratio then will have 500 - 1k write per second. For write, we won't need multiple app instances.\n\nSo, we can have microservice architecture. One service will handle the write and which doesn't need to be scale.\nand another service will handle all the reads which will scale i.e. multiple instances of it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
